{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06562","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 九 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空山暮雨来，衆鸟竟栖息。\n斯须照夕阳，双双复抚翼。\n我念天时好，东田有稼穑。\n浮云蔽川原，新流集沟洫。\n裴回顾衡宇，僮仆邀我食。\n卧览牀头书，睡看机中织。\n想见明膏煎，中夜起唧唧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}